# Everything the research harness GENERATES comes from a production-copy database
# — real names, real email addresses, real amounts. Scripts are versionable; their
# output never is. Verified 2026-08-04: variants/ and prompts/ held 300+ lines of
# live customer data while only corpus/ and runs/ were ignored, so a `git add -A`
# would have committed it to a public MIT repo.
research/corpus/
research/runs/
research/variants/
research/prompts/
research/answers/
research/*.json
# Session scratch (dictation capture, copilot state) — never versioned.
.set/
